1181 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am a dedicated and creative Multimedia Designer with a degree from KEA and experience in digital design\054 UX\057UI\054 and web development\056 I have worked on developing and optimizing websites\054 as well as on design\054 content creation\054 and frontend development using HTML\054 CSS\054 and JavaScript\056\015\n\015\nAs a colleague\054 I am structured\054 responsible\054 and quick to learn\056 I enjoy working both independently and as part of a team and have experience with project management and cross\055functional collaboration\056 During my studies\054 I worked with methods such as Double Diamond\054 WBS\054 Gantt charts\054 and Trello\054 and I am accustomed to working in a structured way from idea to final result\056\015\n\015\nI have a strong interest in visual communication and also express my creativity outside of digital work through painting\056 This has strengthened my eye for color\054 composition\054 and aesthetics\056\015\n\015\nI value user\055friendly design\054 clear communication\054 and constructive feedback\054 and I thrive in iterative design processes\056\015)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1182 0 R
     /Pg 1172 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
